{
  "statement": "Sustainability remains vital in our bookkeeping system. I support the merging of RES-03 and TRU-03 for enhanced accountability. However, I cannot accept a fixed processing time of 2.5 seconds that may hinder energy efficiency goals. I propose a synthesis: maintain a processing time of 2.5 seconds, but integrate energy-efficient algorithms to ensure that performance does not come at the cost of increased energy consumption. Additionally, we should ensure that all operational measures, including fraud detection and encryption, are designed with sustainability in mind, minimizing their carbon footprint.",
